OL,4,CSecond teen charged with attempted     
OL,5,Cmurder over stabbing                   
OL,6,GA second teenager has been charged     
OL,7,Gwith attempted murder after an 18-year-
OL,8,Gold man was seriously injured in a     
OL,9,Gstabbing in Liverpool city centre.     
OL,11,FA 16-year-old boy from Wavertree, who  
OL,12,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, has 
OL,13,Falready been charged with attempted    
OL,14,Fmurder and possession of a bladed      
OL,15,Farticle in a public place.             
OL,17,FMerseyside Police said 19-year-old     
OL,18,FMajeed Habibi, of Stanley Road,        
OL,19,FBootle, has now been charged with the  
OL,20,Fsame offences.                         
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
