OL,4,CFace masks return in two hospitals due 
OL,5,Cto winter virus rise                   
OL,6,GTwo hospitals have reintroduced face   
OL,7,Gmasks in inpatient areas amid a rise   
OL,8,Gin viruses such as Covid-19 and flu.   
OL,10,FThe Lancashire Teaching Hospitals NHS  
OL,11,FFoundation Trust said face masks would 
OL,12,Fbe required in parts of the Royal      
OL,13,FPreston Hospital and Chorley and South 
OL,14,FRibble Hospital to protect staff,      
OL,15,Fpatients and visitors.                 
OL,17,FSteve Canty, the trust's chief medical 
OL,18,Fofficer, said: "We are seeing a        
OL,19,Fsustained increase in the number of    
OL,20,Fpatients testing positive with flu and 
OL,21,Fother winter illnesses."               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
