OL,4,CIndependent body to scrutinise pool's  
OL,5,Cswim lessons                           
OL,6,GAn independent body is to scrutinise   
OL,7,Gswimming lessons at a leisure centre   
OL,8,Gfollowing a dispute.                   
OL,10,FPenrith Swimming Club, which has run   
OL,11,Flessons at Penrith Leisure Centre for  
OL,12,Fdecades, was told in August it does    
OL,13,Fnot have a formal agreement to stage   
OL,14,Fits classes at its teaching pool       
OL,15,Ffollowing a dispute with its operator  
OL,16,FGreenwich Leisure Limited (GLL).       
OL,18,FGLL previously said it valued "all our 
OL,19,Fpool users" and had discussed with the 
OL,20,Fclub "how we can retain their          
OL,21,Finvolvement for the benefit of         
OL,22,Fswimmers".                        G3/4 
