OL,4,CDo not move care home residents, say   
OL,5,Ccampaigners                            
OL,6,GCampaigners have urged a council not   
OL,7,Gto close a care home or move its       
OL,8,Gresidents ahead of a decision on its   
OL,9,Gfuture.                                
OL,11,FWestmorland and Furness Council has    
OL,12,Fspent most of 2026 considering whether 
OL,13,Fto close Applethwaite Green care home  
OL,14,Fin Windermere and Grisedale Croft in   
OL,15,FAlston, and will make a decision in    
OL,16,FDecember.                              
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
